@page "/"

<PageTitle>Clarity Belongs - Know what changed</PageTitle>

<div class="shell public-shell">
    <section class="public-hero public-hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">CLARITY BELONGS</div>
            <h1>Stop checking. Know what changed.</h1>
            <p class="public-lead">Clarity watches the things you care about, keeps the history, and tells you when something worth knowing changes.</p>
            <div class="action-row public-actions">
                <AuthorizeView>
                    <Authorized>
                        <a class="button" href="/my-clarity">Open My Clarity</a>
                        <a class="button secondary" href="/add">Add a follow</a>
                    </Authorized>
                    <NotAuthorized>
                        <a class="button" href="/signup">Start free</a>
                        <a class="button secondary" href="/products">See what Clarity can watch</a>
                    </NotAuthorized>
                </AuthorizeView>
            </div>
            <p class="microcopy">No card required for the Free plan.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Example Clarity activity">
            <div class="hero-visual-topline">
                <span class="status-dot"></span>
                <span>Watching 5 things</span>
                <span class="hero-live-pill">Live</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-watch-card hero-watch-card-featured">
                <div class="watch-icon">↗</div>
                <div>
                    <small>Website change</small>
                    <strong>Pricing page updated</strong>
                    <span>Before / after saved</span>
                </div>
                <span class="watch-state changed">Changed</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-watch-card">
                <div class="watch-icon">✓</div>
                <div>
                    <small>Website uptime</small>
                    <strong>softwarebelongs.com</strong>
                    <span>Checked 2 minutes ago</span>
                </div>
                <span class="watch-state healthy">Healthy</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-watch-card">
                <div class="watch-icon">◷</div>
                <div>
                    <small>SSL expiration</small>
                    <strong>Certificate renewal</strong>
                    <span>14 days remaining</span>
                </div>
                <span class="watch-state reminder">Reminder</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-history-line">
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
            </div>
            <p>One calm history instead of constant checking.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-section idea-section">
        <div class="section-intro">
            <div class="eyebrow">ONE SIMPLE IDEA</div>
            <h2>You should not have to keep checking.</h2>
            <p>Clarity observes a source, remembers what it looked like, compares the next observation, preserves the evidence, and only surfaces changes that matter.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-grid">
            <div>
                <span class="flow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M2 12s3.5-6 10-6 10 6 10 6-3.5 6-10 6S2 12 2 12Z" />
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <strong>1</strong>
                <span>Follow something</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="flow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M20 7h-4V3" />
                        <path d="M20 7a8 8 0 1 0 1.2 8" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <strong>2</strong>
                <span>Clarity checks it</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="flow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
                        <path d="M12 7v5l3 2" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <strong>3</strong>
                <span>History builds</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="flow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M18 8a6 6 0 0 0-12 0c0 7-3 7-3 9h18c0-2-3-2-3-9" />
                        <path d="M10 21h4" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <strong>4</strong>
                <span>You learn what changed</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-section monitor-section">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
                <div class="eyebrow">START WITH YOUR INTERNET</div>
                <h2>Five useful monitors. One history.</h2>
            </div>
            <a href="/products">View all products</a>
        </div>
        <div class="product-grid public-product-grid">
            <a class="product-card monitor-card monitor-change" href="/products/website-change">
                <div class="monitor-icon">↗</div>
                <div class="eyebrow">CHANGES</div>
                <h2>Website Change Monitor</h2>
                <p>Know when a public webpage changes and keep before/after evidence.</p>
                <span class="monitor-link">Watch a page →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="product-card monitor-card monitor-uptime" href="/products/website-uptime">
                <div class="monitor-icon">●</div>
                <div class="eyebrow">AVAILABILITY</div>
                <h2>Website Uptime Monitor</h2>
                <p>Know when a website stops responding and when it recovers.</p>
                <span class="monitor-link">Watch uptime →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="product-card monitor-card monitor-ssl" href="/products/ssl-expiration">
                <div class="monitor-icon">◇</div>
                <div class="eyebrow">CERTIFICATES</div>
                <h2>SSL Expiration Monitor</h2>
                <p>Track certificate identity and get expiration reminders before renewal becomes urgent.</p>
                <span class="monitor-link">Watch SSL →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="product-card monitor-card monitor-domain" href="/products/domain-expiration">
                <div class="monitor-icon">◎</div>
                <div class="eyebrow">DOMAINS</div>
                <h2>Domain Expiration Monitor</h2>
                <p>Keep domain expiration history and reminders in the same place as everything else.</p>
                <span class="monitor-link">Watch a domain →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="product-card monitor-card monitor-dns" href="/products/dns-change">
                <div class="monitor-icon">⌘</div>
                <div class="eyebrow">DNS</div>
                <h2>DNS Change Monitor</h2>
                <p>See when the public address set for a domain changes.</p>
                <span class="monitor-link">Watch DNS →</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-section split-callout">
        <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">MY CLARITY</div>
            <h2>One place for what is worth knowing.</h2>
            <p>Instead of five monitoring apps and a pile of notification emails, My Clarity brings attention, recent changes, history, evidence, and alerts into one calm view.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mock-feed">
            <div><span class="badge">Changed</span><strong>Pricing page updated</strong><small>Before / after saved</small></div>
            <div><span class="badge">Recovered</span><strong>Website responding again</strong><small>4 minutes ago</small></div>
            <div><span class="badge">Reminder</span><strong>SSL expires in 14 days</strong><small>Renew before it becomes urgent</small></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-section ecosystem-section">
        <div class="section-intro">
            <div class="eyebrow">HOW CLARITY FITS</div>
            <h2>DO. KNOW. HANDLE.</h2>
            <p>Clarity Belongs is the KNOW part of a simple three-part ecosystem.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ecosystem-grid">
            <a href="https://softwarebelongs.com"><strong>Software Belongs</strong><span>DO — useful tools to get things done.</span></a>
            <div class="ecosystem-current"><strong>Clarity Belongs</strong><span>KNOW — see what changed and what matters.</span></div>
            <div><strong>AutoPilot IT</strong><span>HANDLE — technology handled for businesses.</span></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="public-cta">
        <div class="eyebrow">START SMALL</div>
        <h2>Follow five things for free.</h2>
        <p>Pick a website, certificate, domain, or DNS target. Clarity will build the history from there.</p>
        <AuthorizeView>
            <Authorized>
                <a class="button" href="/add">Add a follow</a>
            </Authorized>
            <NotAuthorized>
                <a class="button" href="/signup">Create your free account</a>
            </NotAuthorized>
        </AuthorizeView>
    </section>
</div>
